/- A homomorphism from the free monoid on one generator is determined
by the image of that generator, which can be any element of the target monoid. -/
ritual ✨A✨Lone✨Seed✨Holds✨All✨ ⟡ ⟪✨Primordial✨Choir✨ Mote ↝⊛ ᛗ⟫ ≃ ᛗ ⇰
